# SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0-or-later
# Beamline: remove Shell extension loading at build time (§7.1, 0.0.4 step 5).
# Baseline: GNOME Shell 29380c2662daaed660cd6d0115cdfe370510d8f6.
# -Dextensions=false compiles inert API implementations instead of the loader/downloader,
# omits extension preferences and the CLI, and reports support as disabled on D-Bus.
# The default remains the upstream behavior for a future separate advanced desktop.

